<div class="container BannerBg">
    <div class="innervootbg">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="column">
                <h1>Privacy Policy – Fareschoices.com</h1>
                @{Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/Shared/_SearchEngine.cshtml");}

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="column">
            <p>Privacy policy is important to explore before exploring product and services of this website. By exploring and buying the product or services of this website, means you are agreeing as per the terms of privacy policy mentioned on the above page. We ensure the user safety and their data safety but sometimes some information is important to collect for our travel services.</p>
            <p>At Fareschoices.com, your privacy matters to us. This page explains what information we collect, why we collect it, and how we keep it safe. We believe in being clear and honest, so everything is written in simple words.</p>
            <p>By using Fareschoices.com, you agree to this Privacy Policy.</p>
            <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>We collect very limited information, only what is needed to make the website work better for you.</p>
            <h3>a) Information You Share with Us</h3>
            <p>When you contact us, subscribe to updates, or fill out a form, you may share:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid2" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Your name</li>
                <li>Your email address</li>
                <li>Your message or query</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You choose what you share. We never ask for unnecessary details.</p>
            <h3>b) Automatic Information</h3>
            <p>When you visit Fareschoices.com, some basic data is collected automatically, such as:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid2" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Device type (mobile or desktop)</li>
                <li>Browser name</li>
                <li>Pages you visit</li>
                <li>Time spent on pages</li>
                <li>General location (country or city level)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This data does not identify you personally.</p>
            <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We use collected information only for good reasons, such as:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid1" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>To reply to your messages or questions</li>
                <li>To improve website content and user experience</li>
                <li>To understand which pages are helpful</li>
                <li>To keep the website safe and working properly</li>
            </ul>
            <p>We do not use your information for spam.</p>
            <h2>3. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
            <p>Fareschoices.com uses cookies to improve your browsing experience. Cookies help us:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid1" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Remember basic preferences</li>
                <li>Understand which pages people like</li>
                <li>Improve site speed and performance</li>
            </ul>
            <p>You can disable cookies in your browser anytime. The website will still work, but some features may not work perfectly.</p>
            <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>We may use trusted third-party tools such as:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid1" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Analytics tools to understand website traffic</li>
                <li>Advertising partners to show relevant ads</li>
            </ul>
            <p>These third parties may use cookies or similar technologies. They follow their own privacy rules. Fareschoices.com does not control how they use your data.</p>
            <h2>5. Links to Other Websites</h2>
            <p>Our website may contain links to other travel or airline websites.</p>
            <p>Once you leave Fareschoices.com, our Privacy Policy does not apply. We recommend reading the privacy policy of any website you visit.</p>
            <h2>6. How We Protect Your Data</h2>
            <p>We take reasonable steps to keep your information safe, including:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid2" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Secure servers</li>
                <li>Limited access to data</li>
                <li>Regular website checks</li>
            </ul>
            <p>However, no website on the internet is 100% secure. We do our best, but we cannot promise absolute security.</p>
            <h2>7. Children’s Privacy</h2>
            <p>Fareschoices.com is not made for children under 13 years of age.</p>
            <p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
            <p>If you believe a child has shared information with us, please contact us and we will remove it.</p>
            <h2>8. Your Rights and Choices</h2>
            <p>You have the right to:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid1" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Ask what data we have about you</li>
                <li>Request correction or deletion of your information</li>
                <li>Stop receiving emails from us</li>
                <li>You can contact us anytime for these requests.</li>
            </ul>
            <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when needed.</p>
            <p>Any changes will be posted on this page with a new update date.</p>
            <p>Please check this page once in a while.</p>
            <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, you can contact us at:</p>
            <ul class="grid grid1" style="gap: 0;list-style-type: disc;margin-left: 18px;">
                <li>Email: support@Fareschoices.com</li>
                <li>Website: Fareschoices.com</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Thank you for trusting Fareschoices.com.</p>
            <p>We respect your privacy and work hard to keep it safe.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

